Bundle-Description: Creates a Liferay module project that mocks an external API and consumes it through a configurable client.
Bundle-Name: Liferay Project Templates External API Mock
Bundle-SymbolicName: com.liferay.project.templates.external.api.mock
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0
Liferay-Versions: [7,9999.0)
-removeheaders:\
	Import-Package,\
	Private-Package,\
	Require-Capability